1
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:30,440
Be careful of Gu Xingcan.

2
00:01:26,140 --> 00:01:27,680
Um, Lawyer Gu.

3
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,539
This is the newly hired legal counsel.

4
00:01:31,539 --> 00:01:33,600
He will be your assistant from now on.

5
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:36,280
My assistant?

6
00:01:39,060 --> 00:01:39,900
Got it.

7
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:46,440
Follow me.

8
00:01:52,100 --> 00:01:53,860
In my previous memory,

9
00:01:54,479 --> 00:01:56,700
this person didn't seem to appear.

10
00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:07,740
He's like a block of wood.

11
00:02:08,639 --> 00:02:10,840
I really don't know how HR finds people.

12
00:02:16,300 --> 00:02:17,400
You don't need to follow me.

13
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:18,560
Go do your own work.

14
00:02:25,100 --> 00:02:25,900
Gu Xingcan.

15
00:02:31,100 --> 00:02:32,060
Don't come any closer.

16
00:02:32,060 --> 00:02:33,320
Don't come any closer.

17
00:02:35,260 --> 00:02:36,040
Let me go.

18
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:37,460
I won't hurt you.

19
00:03:02,140 --> 00:03:03,470
I'm here to protect you.

20
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:07,400
Protect me?

21
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:13,650
Come here right now.

22
00:03:28,160 --> 00:03:30,079
Y-Your name is?

23
00:03:30,900 --> 00:03:31,520
Chen Yao.

24
00:03:32,820 --> 00:03:34,500
I have something to take care of.

25
00:03:34,500 --> 00:03:35,300
You go...

26
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:36,890
Get in the car first.

27
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:47,100
Traitor. I will never trust you again.

28
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:48,980
Miss Mu.

29
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:50,660
You're here.

30
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:53,800
Then I'll get straight to the point.

31
00:03:54,260 --> 00:03:56,190
No matter how much Lingze pays you,

32
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:58,260
I will pay you more.

33
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,200
Name a price.

34
00:04:00,900 --> 00:04:02,360
Help me win this lawsuit.

35
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:06,380
Miss Mu, are you trying to make me betray my company?

36
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:07,660
As long as you help me,

37
00:04:08,460 --> 00:04:10,520
not only will I give you a sum of money,

38
00:04:11,160 --> 00:04:13,820
but I'll also introduce you to a bigger company.

39
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,280
And I promise

40
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:17,760
you won't have any more worries.

41
00:04:18,300 --> 00:04:19,079
How about it?

42
00:04:19,300 --> 00:04:20,100
I'm sorry.

43
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:22,000
I am only loyal to my boss.

44
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:24,940
I didn't expect

45
00:04:25,940 --> 00:04:27,680
you to be such a loyal dog.

46
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,000
Aren't you afraid

47
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:33,320
that I'll tell everything?

48
00:04:34,100 --> 00:04:36,700
In the end, we'll both go down together.

49
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:39,200
Miss Mu,

50
00:04:39,960 --> 00:04:41,760
I hope you understand one thing.

51
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,980
The fish might die,

52
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:46,659
but the net won't necessarily break.

53
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,600
To the company,

54
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:50,520
you are now nothing but a tool

55
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:52,500
that is no longer needed after use.

56
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:55,000
Do you think Mr. Ling

57
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:57,159
would care about what a worthless tool

58
00:04:57,159 --> 00:04:58,440
has to say?

59
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:00,660
Look out for yourself.

60
00:05:00,860 --> 00:05:02,000
See you in court.

61
00:05:02,460 --> 00:05:03,760
Who do you think you are

62
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:04,960
to treat me like this?

63
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,180
Let go.

64
00:05:08,140 --> 00:05:09,360
Do you know who I am?

65
00:05:10,500 --> 00:05:11,660
No matter who you are,

66
00:05:11,660 --> 00:05:12,720
you can't hurt her.

67
00:05:18,260 --> 00:05:19,120
Let go.

68
00:05:22,900 --> 00:05:23,700
Just you wait.

69
00:05:32,659 --> 00:05:33,390
Are you okay?

70
00:05:34,860 --> 00:05:35,790
Why are you here?

71
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:39,120
You didn't tell me where the car was parked.

72
00:05:56,760 --> 00:05:58,700
I don't know if he's a man or a ghost.

73
00:06:02,820 --> 00:06:04,880
It was as if time stood still just now.

74
00:06:05,280 --> 00:06:07,220
Why did those people stop moving?

75
00:06:07,420 --> 00:06:09,020
He said he came to protect me.

76
00:06:09,880 --> 00:06:10,940
He saved me.

77
00:06:11,340 --> 00:06:13,060
How did I come back to this day?

78
00:06:14,500 --> 00:06:15,840
I'll stop thinking about it for now.

79
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:18,000
The key is to stop Mr. Wang from testifying.

80
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:19,800
I just need to stay away from him.

81
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:27,180
What are you doing?

82
00:06:28,380 --> 00:06:29,040
We're here.

83
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:40,240
Mr. Wang.

84
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:40,920
Lawyer Gu.

85
00:06:41,420 --> 00:06:44,150
Didn't you say a video testimony would be enough?

86
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:45,780
I was afraid something might go wrong.

87
00:06:45,780 --> 00:06:47,780
So I'd like to ask you to go in person.

88
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,280
You're so annoying.

89
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,920
If it weren't for Mr. Ling's sake...

90
00:06:53,080 --> 00:06:53,610
Mr. Wang.

91
00:06:54,200 --> 00:06:56,020
We're going to the court to testify.

92
00:06:56,020 --> 00:06:57,480
Do they have to come along?

93
00:06:59,040 --> 00:07:00,920
Witnesses need protection.

94
00:07:02,260 --> 00:07:03,780
Our protection is enough.

95
00:07:04,520 --> 00:07:05,960
Are you capable of that?

96
00:07:06,540 --> 00:07:07,220
Mr. Wang.

97
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:08,860
The court has rules.

98
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:10,540
Only witnesses can enter.

99
00:07:10,580 --> 00:07:12,840
Others cannot enter the courtroom without permission.

100
00:07:12,840 --> 00:07:14,640
I'll have them stand at the door.

101
00:07:15,180 --> 00:07:17,240
Why did they hire someone as stubborn as you?

102
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:17,770
Mr. Wang.

103
00:07:18,020 --> 00:07:18,960
Step aside.

104
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:31,320
Where is the boss?

105
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:34,000
What just happened?

106
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:36,090
How did he get in the car?

107
00:07:37,300 --> 00:07:38,760
How on earth did he do that?

108
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:42,380
Does the defense wish to make a statement?

109
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:48,320
Does the defense admit to the plaintiff's accusations?

110
00:07:48,320 --> 00:07:49,760
Please answer.

111
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:00,440
What's wrong?

112
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,580
I'm fine. It's just a bit hot.

113
00:08:03,580 --> 00:08:04,580
Where to next?

114
00:08:05,380 --> 00:08:07,180
Just drive out of the city first.

115
00:08:07,380 --> 00:08:09,580
As long as this perjury doesn't make it to court,

116
00:08:09,580 --> 00:08:11,380
Lingze won't be able to overturn the case.

117
00:08:11,380 --> 00:08:12,180
Okay.

118
00:08:22,780 --> 00:08:25,580
Can you use this ability infinitely?

119
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:29,420
My body can't take it if I use it too often.

120
00:08:34,179 --> 00:08:34,980
What's wrong?

121
00:08:38,980 --> 00:08:41,780
This is the guy who threw me into the lake last time.

122
00:08:45,040 --> 00:08:45,840
Smash it.

123
00:09:22,280 --> 00:09:24,000
I'm back again.

124
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:52,580
Why are you in my house?

125
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:54,800
How did you get in?

126
00:09:55,380 --> 00:09:57,260
I can go anywhere I want.

127
00:09:58,980 --> 00:10:00,520
These ice creams taste terrible.

128
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:02,380
Get a different flavor next time.

129
00:10:03,280 --> 00:10:04,480
Who exactly are you?

130
00:10:04,820 --> 00:10:06,220
Who told you to follow me?

131
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:09,120
Your father.

132
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:12,780
What nonsense are you talking about?

133
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:14,640
I am a soul ferryman.

134
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:16,040
Your father found me

135
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:18,410
and asked me to protect you.

136
00:10:21,580 --> 00:10:22,580
My dad?

137
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:40,680
It's up there.

138
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:10,580
Hand it over.

139
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:12,720
Stay away from me.

140
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:14,080
Stay away from me.

141
00:11:15,180 --> 00:11:15,740
Do it.

142
00:11:42,880 --> 00:11:44,740
Your time in the human world is up.

143
00:11:45,980 --> 00:11:46,820
Come with me.

144
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:27,820
No.

145
00:12:28,480 --> 00:12:29,580
I can't leave yet.

146
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,840
My daughter still needs me.
